<title>SWITZERLAND: Ares-Serono 1996 sales rise 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Ares-Serono 1996 sales rise 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Group sales		    805.0	     vs 682.3</p>
<p> European sales		 384.4	     vs 327.4</p>
<p> Fourth qtr sales	     242.2	     vs 179.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Swiss pharmaceuticals company is Ares-Serono Group.</p>
<p>Company said sales rose by 18.7 percent in local currencies. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
